Meet Big Family 2.0 - an updated application with a modern design, replacing traditional loyalty systems.

Everything you would like to know about the establishment is already here:
- order for delivery or pickup;
- online booking;
- visualized menu;
- detailed description of food and drinks;
- clear bonus system;
- a real opportunity to pay with bonuses instead of money in selected establishments.

All you have to do is collect loyalty cards in your wallet, download Big Family and take advantage of the new application today!
